      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Acushnet Process Company, now Acushnet Company, was founded in 1910 in Acushnet Center and remains a major local industry.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Acushnet%2C_Massachusetts",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Acushnet River powered industry from the 18th century, and White’s Factory on its banks is a preserved ruin visitors can explore.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
